{"ticker":"NNE","updated":"2026-10-23T23:22:55Z","profile":{"longName":"NANO Nuclear Energy Inc.","shortName":"Nano Nuclear Energy Inc.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","country":"United States","website":"https://nanonuclearenergy.com","fullTimeEmployees":36,"marketCap":652969408,"trailingPE":null,"forwardPE":-12.069478,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3050.6602,"pegRatio":null,"targetMeanPrice":37.14286,"targetHighPrice":50.0,"targetLowPrice":19.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":7,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":null,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.29065,"operatingMargins":-73.782745,"profitMargins":0.0,"totalRevenue":214042,"beta":5.478,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":49.5,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":11.95,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NCM","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"NANO Nuclear Energy Inc. operates as a nuclear energy company. The company is developing KRONOS MMR Energy System, a high-temperature gas-cooled reactor; LOKI MMR, a compact microreactor designed for remote and specialized applications; ZEUS, a solid core battery reactor; and ODIN, a low-pressure salt coolant reactor. It is also developing a high-assay low-enriched uranium fuel processing facility to provide a fuel pipeline for the nuclear reactor industry, and fuel transportation and nuclear consultation businesses. The company was incorporated in 2022 and is based in New York, New York.","summary_zh":"NANO Nuclear Energy Inc. 以核能公司營運。該公司正在開發KRONOS MMR能源系統，這是一種高溫氣冷反應器；LOKI MMR，一種緊湊型微反應器，專為遠端和專業應用而設計；ZEUS，實心電池反應器；和 ODIN，低壓鹽冷卻劑反應器。它還正在開發高含量低濃縮鈾燃料加工設施，為核反應器工業、燃料運輸和核子諮詢業務提供燃料管道。該公司成立於2022年，總部位於紐約州紐約市。","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"特種工業機械","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":31.4,"h":32.082,"l":30.55,"c":30.98,"v":1671600},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":30.75,"h":32.4,"l":30.75,"c":32.33,"v":2585800},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":32.1,"h":33.44,"l":32.02,"c":32.89,"v":2608600},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":33.5,"h":34.85,"l":33.02,"c":34.5,"v":3168900},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":34.0,"h":